OL,3,GNEWSAHospice care eases pressure on
OL,4,Afamilies, mum says
OL,5,
OL,6,FA petition with over 100,000 signatures
OL,7,Fcalling for sustainable hospice funding
OL,8,Fwill be delivered to Downing Street on
OL,9,FTuesday, while a government
OL,10,Fspokesperson said it wanted to
OL,11,Fmodernise the sector.
